{"id": "9e7d22bd-fef3-4f1b-a3a3-ecf06e93866a", "slug": "paperflow-design-layout", "title": "PaperFlow Design Layout", "description": "Paperflow Design Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"PaperFlow Design Layout\"\ndescription: \"Paperflow Design Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#E65C00\"\n  secondary: \"#FDFBF7\"\n  accent: \"#FFB380\"\n  background: \"#FDFBF7\"\n  surface: \"#F7F4EB\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# PaperFlow Design Layout\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 393; favorites: 25; remixes: 7.\nTags: pricing, section, animated, cta, bento, billing.\n## Overview\nPaperflow Design Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nFlow Platform Plans Streamline operations with smart workflows. Optimize your daily tasks and harness data for clear outcomes. Get Started Expand capabilities. @jordanhayes Projects About I'm Jordan Hayes , a product en…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Streamline operations with smart workflows.; Refined product assets; Frameworks.; Inter Sans; Discover crafted interface patterns..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #E65C00, secondary #FDFBF7, accent #FFB380, background #FDFBF7, surface #F7F4EB, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>PaperFlow Design Layout</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&display=swap\">\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <!-- GSAP for animations and ScrollTrigger reveal -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center p-4 md:p-8 lg:p-12 text-stone-800\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #EFECE5; background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 0%, #F8F5EF 0%, transparent 70%);\">\n\n    <!-- Main Outer Container mimicking the image frame -->\n    <main class=\"w-full max-w-[1280px] bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FCFAF6]/90 to-[#F5F2EA]/90 backdrop-blur-3xl rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-[0_8px_40px_rgba(230,92,0,0.03),0_1px_3px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)] p-4 md:p-6 lg:p-8 ring-1 ring-white/60\">\n\n        <!-- Grid Layout -->\n        <div class=\"grid grid-cols-12 gap-4 lg:gap-5\">\n\n            <!-- Card 1: UI Stack -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-3 lg:row-span-2 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FDFBF7] to-[#F7F4EB] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative flex flex-col group transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-lg shadow-sm ring-1 ring-stone-200/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n                <div class=\"flex-1 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#F5EFE6] to-[#FCE8D5] p-6 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                    <!-- Nav fake -->\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-8 relative z-10\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                            <div class=\"w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-[#E65C00]\"></div>\n                            <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-800\">Flow</span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"flex gap-3 text-xs text-stone-500 font-medium\">\n                            <span class=\"hover:text-stone-800 cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Platform</span>\n                            <span class=\"hover:text-stone-800 cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Plans</span>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <!-- Content -->\n                    <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-[85%]\">\n                        <h2 class=\"gsap-reveal text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-tight mb-2 text-stone-900\">Streamline operations with smart workflows.</h2>\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-500 mb-6\">Optimize your daily tasks and harness data for clear outcomes.</p>\n                        <button class=\"bg-[#E65C00] text-white text-xs px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-[#CC5200] transition-all shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(230,92,0,0.2)] hover:shadow-[0_4px_14px_rgba(230,92,0,0.3)]\">Get Started</button>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Abstract UI elements -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute -bottom-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 rounded-full border-[16px] border-[#F2DECE] opacity-90 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-4 w-32 h-32 rounded-full border-[12px] border-white/40 opacity-90 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500 delay-75\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom section of stacked card -->\n                <div class=\"h-32 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#F4EBE1] to-[#FCEEE3] relative border-t border-white/40 p-6 flex flex-col justify-end overflow-hidden\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-[#E65C00] rounded-tl-full opacity-30 blur-2xl translate-x-1/2 translate-y-1/2\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"gsap-reveal text-lg font-medium tracking-tight relative z-10 text-stone-800\">Expand capabilities.</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 2: Intro -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-3 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FDFBF7] to-[#F7F4EB] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative p-6 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-stone-200/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#FFF8EE] via-[#FDFBF7] to-[#FDF4E9] opacity-80\"></div>\n                <!-- Moving gradient blob -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-blob absolute -top-20 -left-20 w-64 h-64 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FFB380] to-[#FFD6AD] rounded-full mix-blend-multiply filter blur-[40px] opacity-40\"></div>\n\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start text-xs font-medium text-stone-500 relative z-10 mb-8\">\n                    <span>@jordanhayes</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-3\">\n                        <span class=\"hover:text-stone-800 cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Projects</span>\n                        <span class=\"hover:text-stone-800 cursor-pointer transition-colors\">About</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                    <p class=\"gsap-reveal text-lg font-normal tracking-tight leading-snug text-stone-700\">I'm <span class=\"font-medium text-stone-900\">Jordan Hayes</span>,<br>a product engineer crafting<br>tools in London.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-end text-xs text-stone-400 mt-6 relative z-10\">\n                    <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#E65C00]\"></span> Open to roles</span>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"hover:text-[#E65C00] cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Github</span>\n                        <span class=\"hover:text-[#E65C00] cursor-pointer transition-colors\">X</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 3: 3D Box placeholder -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-2 bg-[#F5F2EA] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative min-h-[220px] flex items-center justify-center group cursor-pointer shadow-inner ring-1 ring-stone-200/50\">\n                <!-- Faux 3D / Abstract composition -->\n                <div class=\"gsap-float relative w-full h-full flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute w-20 h-28 bg-[#FDFBF7] border border-stone-200/80 rounded-lg shadow-[0_8px_20px_rgba(230,92,0,0.05)] translate-x-4 translate-y-4 rotate-6 z-10 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:rotate-12 group-hover:translate-x-6 group-hover:-translate-y-2\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-8 h-8 bg-gradient-to-tr from-[#E65C00] to-[#FFB380] rounded-full blur-md opacity-40\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute w-16 h-24 bg-[#FAF7F0] border border-stone-200/60 rounded-lg shadow-sm -translate-x-6 -translate-y-2 -rotate-3 z-0 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:-rotate-6 group-hover:-translate-x-8 group-hover:translate-y-2\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-6 h-6 bg-gradient-to-tr from-stone-300 to-stone-200 rounded-full blur-sm opacity-60\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 4: Hero Gradient -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 lg:row-span-2 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FDFBF7] to-[#F7F4EB] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden relative p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[460px] shadow-sm ring-1 ring-stone-200/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n                <!-- Top Nav -->\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-xs font-medium text-stone-500 relative z-20\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-stone-800\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:layers-linear\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        <span>Ecosystem</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"flex gap-4\">\n                        <span class=\"hidden sm:inline hover:text-stone-800 cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Blocks</span>\n                        <span class=\"hidden sm:inline hover:text-stone-800 cursor-pointer transition-colors\">Themes</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-[#E65C00]\">Upgrade</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- WebGL simulated blob -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\">\n                    <div class=\"gsap-blob absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[120%] h-[120%] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-[#FFD6AD] via-[#FCE8D5] to-transparent opacity-40 mix-blend-multiply blur-[60px]\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"gsap-blob-reverse absolute top-1/4 left-1/4 w-[80%] h-[80%] bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-[#E65C00] via-[#FFB380] to-transparent opacity-10 mix-blend-color-burn blur-[50px]\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Main Content -->\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center mt-12 mb-8\">\n                    <h1 class=\"gsap-reveal text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight leading-[1.1] text-stone-900 mb-4 max-w-[280px]\">\n                        Refined product assets\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-500 mb-6 max-w-[220px]\">Subscribe to get exclusive platform components delivered weekly.</p>\n\n                    <div class=\"flex w-full max-w-[280px] bg-[#FDFBF7] rounded-full border border-stone-200 p-1 shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)] transition-all duration-300 focus-within:border-[#E65C00]/50 focus-within:ring-2 focus-within:ring-[#E65C00]/10 focus-within:shadow-md hover:border-stone-300\">\n                        <input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Email address\" class=\"flex-1 bg-transparent px-4 text-sm outline-none placeholder:text-stone-400 font-medium text-stone-800\">\n                        <button class=\"bg-[#E65C00] text-white text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-[#CC5200] transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(230,92,0,0.25)]\">\n                            Subscribe <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Footer -->\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between items-end text-[10px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider mt-auto pt-8 border-t border-stone-200/60\">\n                    <div>\n                        <span class=\"block mb-1\">Latest Drop</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-stone-800 font-medium normal-case tracking-normal text-xs\">Tactile UI Kit</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"text-right\">\n                        <span class=\"block mb-1\">Published</span>\n                        <span class=\"text-stone-800 font-medium normal-case tracking-normal text-xs\">Nov 12, 2023</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 5: Core Text -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-3 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FDFBF7] to-[#F7F4EB] rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-between shadow-sm ring-1 ring-stone-200/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n                <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start text-xs text-stone-400 mb-8\">\n                    <span class=\"uppercase tracking-wider text-[10px]\">Pillar</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-medium text-[#E65C00]\">01</span>\n                </div>\n                <div>\n                    <h3 class=\"gsap-reveal text-xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-2 text-stone-900\">Frameworks.</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-stone-500 font-normal leading-relaxed\">Robust interface frameworks, dynamic components, and polished applications designed for modern scale.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 6: Typography -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-2 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FDFBF7] to-[#F7F4EB] rounded-2xl p-6 flex flex-col justify-center items-center relative overflow-hidden group shadow-sm ring-1 ring-stone-200/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-stone-100/50 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity duration-500\"></div>\n                <h3 class=\"gsap-reveal text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-900 relative z-10 leading-none text-center\">Inter<br>Sans</h3>\n\n                <div class=\"w-full flex justify-between mt-8 text-[10px] text-stone-400 uppercase tracking-wider relative z-10 border-t border-stone-200/60 pt-3\">\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col\"><span>Weights</span><span class=\"text-stone-800 font-medium normal-case text-xs\">9</span></div>\n                    <div class=\"flex flex-col text-right\"><span>Category</span><span class=\"text-stone-800 font-medium normal-case text-xs\">Neo</span></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 7: Palette -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 md:col-span-6 lg:col-span-3 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FDFBF7] to-[#F7F4EB] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-40 shadow-sm ring-1 ring-stone-200/50 p-1\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n                <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#FDFBF7] rounded-t-xl p-3 flex items-start border-b border-stone-100\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-stone-500 tracking-wider uppercase\">Base Light</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#EFECE5] border-b border-stone-200/50\"></div>\n                <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#FFB380] border-b border-orange-200/50\"></div>\n                <div class=\"flex-1 bg-[#E65C00] rounded-b-xl flex items-end justify-end p-2\">\n                    <span class=\"text-[10px] font-medium text-white/80 tracking-wider uppercase\">Action</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 8: Discover -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FDFBF7] to-[#F7F4EB] rounded-2xl p-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center shadow-sm ring-1 ring-stone-200/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-6\">\n                    <div class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#FFF5E6] flex items-center justify-center text-[#E65C00] shadow-[inset_0_1px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] ring-1 ring-[#E65C00]/10\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:compass-square-linear\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs font-medium tracking-tight text-stone-600\">Collection</span>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"gsap-reveal text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-3 text-stone-900\">Discover crafted interface patterns.</h2>\n                <p class=\"text-sm text-stone-500 mb-6 max-w-md\">Showcasing hundreds of premium interactions and tailored layouts for SaaS applications.</p>\n                <button class=\"bg-white text-stone-800 text-xs px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full font-medium hover:text-[#E65C00] transition-colors flex items-center gap-2 shadow-[0_2px_10px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04),inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,1)] ring-1 ring-stone-200\">\n                    Explore Gallery <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-up-linear\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Card 9: Logo -->\n            <div class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#FDFBF7] to-[#F7F4EB] rounded-2xl p-8 flex items-center justify-center group cursor-pointer shadow-sm ring-1 ring-stone-200/50\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.8), 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 transition-transform duration-500 ease-out group-hover:scale-105\">\n                    <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-[#E65C00] to-[#FF8C40] flex items-center justify-center text-white shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(230,92,0,0.3)]\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-linear\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-stone-900\">PaperFlow</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // Masked Staggered Word Reveal\n            document.querySelectorAll('.gsap-reveal').forEach(el => {\n                const text = el.innerText;\n                el.innerHTML = '';\n                const words = text.split(' ');\n\n                words.forEach((word, i) => {\n                    const wordWrap = document.createElement('span');\n                    wordWrap.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wordWrap.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                    wordWrap.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                    wordWrap.style.paddingRight = i < words.length - 1 ? '0.25em' : '0';\n\n                    const wordInner = document.createElement('span');\n                    wordInner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                    wordInner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%)';\n                    wordInner.style.transformOrigin = 'top left';\n                    wordInner.innerText = word;\n                    wordInner.className = 'reveal-word';\n\n                    wordWrap.appendChild(wordInner);\n                    el.appendChild(wordWrap);\n                });\n\n                gsap.to(el.querySelectorAll('.reveal-word'), {\n                    y: '0%',\n                    ease: 'power3.out',\n                    duration: 0.9,\n                    stagger: 0.04,\n                    scrollTrigger: {\n                        trigger: el,\n                        start: 'top 95%',\n                        toggleActions: 'play none none none'\n                    }\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Ambient Blob Animations\n            gsap.to('.gsap-blob', {\n                rotation: 360,\n                scale: 1.15,\n                x: 20,\n                y: -20,\n                duration: 25,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut'\n            });\n\n            gsap.to('.gsap-blob-reverse', {\n                rotation: -360,\n                scale: 1.2,\n                x: -30,\n                y: 20,\n                duration: 30,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut'\n            });\n\n            // Gentle Float Animation\n            gsap.to('.gsap-float > div', {\n                y: -8,\n                duration: 4,\n                repeat: -1,\n                yoyo: true,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut',\n                stagger: {\n                    each: 1,\n                    from: \"start\"\n                }\n            });\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "paperflow-design-layout.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/paperflow-design-layout.jpg", "source_name": "paperflow-design-layout-DESIGN.md", "views": 2127, "forks": 119, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T18:37:50.778206+00:00"}